# Routing provider configuration — a DEVELOPMENT-ONLY convenience. Copy this
# file to `.env`, pick one provider, and set its API key, so `npm run dev`
# comes up straight into the map instead of the credentials screen every
# visitor sees on a production build. See README.md for how to obtain a key
# for each provider.
#
# These variables have no effect on a production build (`npm run build`),
# even if set — a production build never embeds a routing API key. Each
# visitor supplies their own at runtime instead (see
# docs/adr/0001-user-supplied-routing-api-key-in-browser-storage.md). Never
# commit a real key here regardless.

# One of: openrouteservice, mapbox
VITE_ROUTING_PROVIDER=openrouteservice
VITE_ROUTING_API_KEY=
